Subject: [PATCH 3/7] platform: add WASIX runtime services

Provide the platform pieces required by a static, threaded WASIX server:
pthread-backed statement timers, a static dynamic-loader compatibility shim,
and resource-group stubs for unsupported affinity and priority operations.

